    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to prohibiting\nthe sale of certain products that contain regulated perfluoroalkyl and\npolyfluoroalkyl substances",
    "basePrintNo": "S9073",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9073-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
